Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:06.09,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm very happy to be back here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴能回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:09.63,EN,,0,0,0,,in Osaka after 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:09.63,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}14{\fs68} 年后再回大坂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.34,EN,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:12.99,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:12.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家前来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:13.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and supporting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.87,EN,,0,0,0,,They are an incredible audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,观众们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:16.94,EN,,0,0,0,,truly supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:16.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的非常支持我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you once again for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次感谢大家前来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:41.91,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done, Ashlyn, for a great week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿什琳 这周打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and a great season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季也很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your break and good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好休假 祝好运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.26,EN,,0,0,0,,for the coming year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,迎接新的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope we play more games together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望我们多交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:55.86,EN,,0,0,0,,you're an amazing player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是非常出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:01:11.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Many thanks to the tournament director,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:01:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢赛事总监
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,the supervisor, and all the sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,裁判长和所有赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.64,EN,,0,0,0,,The truth is that this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 这站赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.20,EN,,0,0,0,,was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.11,EN,,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,我非常享受一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you for doing this for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们为我们付出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.90,EN,,0,0,0,,we feel right at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们宾至如归
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.02,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望能再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:27.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周我非常享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:42.05,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之 感谢一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:49.75,EN,,0,0,0,,And I would like to thank my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还要感谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.51,EN,,0,0,0,,my coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,He's always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,他一直在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.90,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you for supporting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to those who support me from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在家支持我的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:07.43,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you, my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:18.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:21.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Arigato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿里嘎多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:37.98,EN,,0,0,0,,We would like to have a photo shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们想和颁奖嘉宾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:38.91,EN,,0,0,0,,with the presenters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起合影
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:40.41,EN,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么
